        "text": "$|OB| = |OD|$ (radii), so the base angles of triangle $ODB$ are equal. Both are $X$."
       },
       {
        "text": "The angles in a triangle add to $180^\\circ$."
       },
       {
        "tex": "2X &= 180 - 50"
       },
       {
        "tex": "2X &= 130"
       },
       {
        "tex": "X &= 65"
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
    "final": "X = 65^\\circ"
