     {
      "title": "Find the base angle of triangle OBC",
      "lines": [
       {
        "text": "$|OB| = |OC|$, so triangle $OBC$ is isosceles and its base angles are equal."
       },
       {
        "text": "Angles in a triangle add to $180^\\circ$, and $|\\angle BOC| = 72^\\circ$."
       },
       {
        "tex": "|\\angle OBC| &= \\frac{180 - 72}{2}"
       },
